stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CredentialEntry
    CredentialEntry: Credential Entry / "Enter your username, then your PIN" / accessible labelled fields, no CAPTCHA
    CredentialEntry --> BiometricPrompt: credential accepted
    CredentialEntry --> CredentialError: credential rejected

    CredentialError: Error Announced / "That PIN was not recognised. Try again" / spoken immediately, focus stays on field
    CredentialError --> CredentialEntry

    BiometricPrompt: Biometric Prompt / "Second step: scan your fingerprint or face" / haptic buzz + spoken cue, platform dialogue
    BiometricPrompt --> VoiceCallPending: biometric match
    BiometricPrompt --> BiometricRetry: no match (attempt less than 3)
    BiometricPrompt --> Locked: no match (attempt equals 3)

    BiometricRetry: Retry Announced / "Not recognised, try again"
    BiometricRetry --> BiometricPrompt

    VoiceCallPending: Voice Call Placed / "Third step: we are calling your phone now" / live status announced, timer extendable
    VoiceCallPending --> CodeEntry: call answered, code read

    CodeEntry: Code Entry / "Enter the 6-digit code, or say repeat during the call" / accessible numeric field, press 1 to replay
    CodeEntry --> Authenticated: code correct
    CodeEntry --> CodeError: code incorrect or expired

    CodeError: Error Announced / "That code did not match. Requesting a new call" / spoken, offers retry
    CodeError --> VoiceCallPending: rate limit allows

    Authenticated: Authenticated / "You are signed in" spoken confirmation
    Authenticated --> [*]

    Locked: Account Temporarily Locked / "Too many attempts. Try again in 10 minutes, or contact support"
    Locked --> [*]
